    "body": "Hmm, this is interesting. Theoretically a user agent could support the processing model for this, if it were a search engine that executed JavaScript. But in practice it's quite unlikely. So in most cases it should not appear in supports().\r\n\r\nMaybe that deserves a note just below this, stating basically what I just said?",
